title: "Fruit Image Classification Pipeline"

abstract: >
  A complete fruit image classification workflow incorporating image
  preprocessing, deep feature extraction using pretrained convolutional
  neural networks, and machine learning-based classification. The pipeline
  supports automated dataset preparation, preprocessing, feature extraction,
  model training, evaluation, and result generation for banana and guava
  image datasets.

